{"summary":"Timeless block Puzzle will bring to you a lot of fun! Join millions players.","description":"<b>Quadris®: timeless puzzle</b> Rules:\n- Draw puzzle blocks and clear rows to unblock new bricks.\n- You can draw the puzzle blocks.\n- See which puzzle blocks are coming up next and strategize. \n\n<b>Quadris®: timeless puzzle</b> <b>Features</b>:\n\nPuzzle Game for Free!\n- Block puzzles like you’ve never seen them before! Old school bricks get a totally new ruleset\n- This free classic brick game offers endless value as you keep coming back to perfect your strategy\n\nBrain Training Challenges\n\n- The brain challenge begins! Expand your mind to come up with strategic ways to clear the board\n- Brain teasers will push you to think outside the box to find the solution\n- Memory, spatial reasoning and puzzle solving skills will all be tested and improved with Quadris\n- Brain block puzzle games, worldwide! <b>Quadris®: classic puzzle</b> is available worldwide in 16 languages\n- Puzzle Leaderboards – See who has the highest scores\n- Support for tablet devices\n- Convenient user interface and easy operation\n- Available offline\n\nSimple. Addictive. Classic. Quadris is the brain training puzzle brick game you’ve been waiting for!\n\nDownload <b>Quadris®: timeless puzzle</b> and start solving brain puzzles today!\n\n<b>Thanks for playing!</b>","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$9.99 - $10.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kwCKRYbzkc4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BwknMgMLr228Ua10k6436AELF2tzAuVa0yog3NT5Vvu9EcVwQ_izK_2PSbMzR8L9-o-3Saqu1axkbheman1p","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Uj7rAPn2LtMJaBWWWr2luI9sdkr3swzGVL4a3cPb-PgJtvOBNlqyDAZZrLkwkGkb8rwh5xYMYl3UdEYrdUSc2A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qGB9Sdmf5SDfPSEu4pwXZlE3HfjTUo2096DpddVsRW_4BJpDTjct3OpEsPduJ3ECJmwVAIvYyzNpA4QFBtoXjg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TUHQLU4q58edSCNO1LErMmsl_k